    <h1>Building AI <span class="accent">REST Endpoints</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Design production-grade endpoints for model inference, batch processing, and async tasks. Learn best practices for handling file uploads, streaming responses, and managing model lifecycle.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="objectives"><h4>Learning Objectives</h4><ul>
    <li>Design REST endpoints for AI inference with proper schema design</li>
    <li>Handle file uploads and multipart form data for documents and images</li>
    <li>Implement streaming responses for long-running model inference</li>
    <li>Manage model loading and lifecycle with dependency injection</li>
    <li>Design batch prediction endpoints with job tracking</li>
  </ul></div>

  <section class="section" id="inference-endpoints">
    <h2>Designing Inference Endpoints</h2>
    <p>Production inference endpoints require careful design for input validation, error handling, and response consistency. Here's a comprehensive inference endpoint pattern:</p>
    <div class="code-example"><code><span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">fastapi</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">FastAPI</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="nm">Depends</span>
<span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">pydantic</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">BaseModel</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="nm">Field</span>
<span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">typing</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">Optional</span>
<span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">time</span>

<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="nm">TextRequest</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">BaseModel</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="nm">text</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">str</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">Field</span><span class="op">(...,</span> <span class="nm">min_length</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">1</span><span class="op">)</span>
    <span class="nm">return_probs</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">bool</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="kw">False</span>
    <span class="nm">top_k</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">Optional</span><span class="op">[</span><span class="bi">int</span><span class="op">]</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="nm">None</span>

<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="nm">Prediction</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">BaseModel</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="nm">label</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">str</span>
    <span class="nm">confidence</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">float</span>
    <span class="nm">probabilities</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">Optional</span><span class="op">[</span><span class="bi">dict</span><span class="op">]</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="kw">None</span>

<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="nm">InferenceResponse</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">BaseModel</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="nm">predictions</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">Prediction</span>
    <span class="nm">model_version</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">str</span>
    <span class="nm">latency_ms</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">float</span>
    <span class="nm">request_id</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">str</span>

<span class="op">@</span><span class="nm">app</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">post</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="st">"/classify"</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="nm">response_model</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">InferenceResponse</span><span class="op">)</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">classify</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">request</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">TextRequest</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="nm">start_time</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">()</span>
    <span class="nm">request_id</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">str</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">())</span>

    <span class="cm"># Run inference</span>
    <span class="nm">prediction</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">model</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">predict</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">request</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="nm">text</span><span class="op">)</span>

    <span class="nm">latency_ms</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="op">(</span><span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">time</span><span class="op">()</span> <span class="op">-</span> <span class="nm">start_time</span><span class="op">)</span> <span class="op">*</span> <span class="nm">1000</span>

    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="nm">InferenceResponse</span><span class="op">(</span>
        <span class="nm">predictions</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">prediction</span><span class="op">,</span>
        <span class="nm">model_version</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="st">"1.0.0"</span><span class="op">,</span>
        <span class="nm">latency_ms</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">latency_ms</span><span class="op">,</span>
        <span class="nm">request_id</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">request_id</span>
    <span class="op">)</span></code></div>

    <div class="callout">
      <div class="callout-title">Best Practice: Include Metadata</div>
      <p>Always return latency, model version, and request IDs for monitoring and debugging. These fields enable you to track inference performance, identify model version impacts, and correlate client requests with logs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="file-uploads">
    <h2>Handling File Uploads</h2>
    <p>FastAPI supports multipart file uploads natively. Handle documents and images with proper validation:</p>
    <div class="code-example"><code><span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">fastapi</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">File</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="nm">UploadFile</span>

<span class="op">@</span><span class="nm">app</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">post</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="st">"/extract-text"</span><span class="op">)</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">extract_text</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">file</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">UploadFile</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">File</span><span class="op">(...)):</span>
    <span class="cm"># Validate file type</span>
    <span class="kw">if</span> <span class="nm">file</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="nm">content_type</span> <span class="op">not</span> <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="op">[</span><span class="st">"application/pdf"</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="st">"text/plain"</span><span class="op">]:</span>
        <span class="kw">raise</span> <span class="fn">HTTPException</span><span class="op">(</span>
            <span class="nm">status_code</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="nm">400</span><span class="op">,</span>
            <span class="nm">detail</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="st">"Only PDF and TXT files allowed"</span>
        <span class="op">)</span>

    <span class="cm"># Read file contents</span>
    <span class="nm">contents</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="kw">await</span> <span class="nm">file</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">read</span><span class="op">()</span>

    <span class="cm"># Process document</span>
    <span class="nm">extracted_text</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">extract_from_document</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">contents</span><span class="op">)</span>

    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="op">{</span><span class="st">"text"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">extracted_text</span><span class="op">}</span>

<span class="cm"># Multiple files</span>
<span class="op">@</span><span class="nm">app</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">post</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="st">"/batch-process"</span><span class="op">)</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">batch_process</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">files</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="bi">list</span><span class="op">[</span><span class="nm">UploadFile</span><span class="op">]</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">File</span><span class="op">(...)):</span>
    <span class="nm">results</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="op">[]</span>
    <span class="kw">for</span> <span class="nm">file</span> <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="nm">files</span><span class="op">:</span>
        <span class="nm">contents</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="kw">await</span> <span class="nm">file</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">read</span><span class="op">()</span>
        <span class="nm">results</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">append</span><span class="op">({</span>
            <span class="st">"filename"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">file</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="nm">filename</span><span class="op">,</span>
            <span class="st">"size"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="fn">len</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">contents</span><span class="op">)</span>
        <span class="op">})</span>
    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="op">{</span><span class="st">"processed"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">results</span><span class="op">}</span></code></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="streaming">
    <h2>Streaming Responses</h2>
    <p>For long-running inference tasks, stream responses to the client instead of blocking:</p>
    <div class="code-example"><code><span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">fastapi</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">StreamingResponse</span>
<span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">json</span>

<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">generate_embeddings</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">texts</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="cm"># Stream embeddings as they're computed</span>
    <span class="kw">for</span> <span class="nm">i</span><span class="op">,</span> <span class="nm">text</span> <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">enumerate</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">texts</span><span class="op">):</span>
        <span class="nm">embedding</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">embed_text</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">text</span><span class="op">)</span>
        <span class="nm">result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="nm">json</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">dumps</span><span class="op">({</span>
            <span class="st">"index"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">i</span><span class="op">,</span>
            <span class="st">"embedding"</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">embedding</span>
        <span class="op">})</span> <span class="op">+</span> <span class="st">"\n"</span>
        <span class="kw">yield</span> <span class="nm">result</span>

<span class="op">@</span><span class="nm">app</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">post</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="st">"/embed-batch"</span><span class="op">)</span>
<span class="kw">async def</span> <span class="fn">embed_batch</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">request</span><span class="op">:</span> <span class="nm">BatchRequest</span><span class="op">):</span>
    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="nm">StreamingResponse</span><span class="op">(</span>
        <span class="fn">generate_embeddings</span><span class="op">(</span><span class="nm">request</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="nm">texts</span><span class="op">),</span>
        <span class="nm">media_type</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="st">"application/x-ndjson"</span>
    <span class="op">)</span></code></div>

